    <statement><p>Find the linearization <m>L(x,y,z)</m> of the <m>\displaystyle f(x,y,z) = 6 \sqrt{x^3+y^3+z^3}</m> at the point <m>(1,2,3)</m>.</p>
<p>Answer: <m>L(x,y,z) =</m> <fillin characters="30" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>1.5\mathopen{}\left(x-1\right)+6\mathopen{}\left(y-2\right)+13.5\mathopen{}\left(z-3\right)+36</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
